# ROVEXO Full Width Engine v1.0 (LOCKED)

**STATUS: UI LOCK | MASTER FULL WIDTH CONTRACT v1.1**

## Golden rule

One platform = one design system. Profile is the official visual reference for internal UI.

**Design Protection Absolute v1.1 (P0):** Owner-approved design always wins. Engines adapt **to** the design — the design never adapts to the engine. Full Width Absolute Law: 100% width/height · zero overflow/cropping/misalignment/redesign. See `design-protection-absolute-v1.mdc` · `full-width-absolute-law-v1.mdc`.

Every account surface must use Full Width Engine via `AccountCanonicalShell`
(`data-full-width-engine="v1.0"` + `data-master-full-width`).

## Spec (Master Contract tokens · Design Decision #001)

- Width: **100%** only (never 70/80/85/90/95% or centered cards)
- Internal L/R padding: **16px** · Homepage L/R: **24px** (LOCKED)
- Vertical / section padding: **24px** (unchanged)
- Header: **64px** · Primary button / input: **56px** · Radius: **16px** · Touch ≥ **44px**
- Rows: **100%** width · flat · chevron `>` identical platform-wide
- Primary CTA: **100%** width
- Sheets / modals: **100%** width

## Forbidden

Borders · cards · shadows · containers · boxes · rounded cards · section borders · custom widths · custom spacing · secondary design systems

## Engine SSOT

- `lib/design-system/design-decision-001-internal-ui-v1.1.ts`
